<title>SPAIN: Spain's Pryca H1 net rises 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Pryca H1 net rises 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for retailer Pryca for the first six months to end June in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit/loss		   11.315    vs  9.096</p>
<p> Net taxed				7.752     vs  6.258</p>
<p> Gross sales			    275.001   vs  268.007</p>
<p> Net sales				249.218   vs  243.051</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of group is Pryca S.A.</p>
<p>The group also said group sales through the end of August were 377.484, up 0.9 perent over the same period a year ago.</p>
</text>
